WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:05.698
<v Dev>Dev: The walking lens shows it. Eighteen minutes from my house. Too far!

2
00:00:05.768 --> 00:00:08.313
<v Florence>Florence: Oops. I read “the middle” too exactly.

3
00:00:08.383 --> 00:00:11.610
<v Posy>Posy: School within a 15-minute walk of every home.

4
00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.618
<v Florence>Florence: Moved! Now every home is close enough. Checked!

5
00:00:14.688 --> 00:00:18.821
<v Florence>Florence: One more thing. People want more car parks! I asked ten of them.

6
00:00:18.891 --> 00:00:20.386
<v Dev>Dev: Where did you ask?

7
00:00:20.456 --> 00:00:21.715
<v Florence>Florence: At the car park.

8
00:00:21.785 --> 00:00:25.094
<v Posy>Posy: So you only asked drivers! Ask at the school gate too.

9
00:00:25.164 --> 00:00:27.765
Keep school a short walk from every home.

10
00:00:27.835 --> 00:00:33.013
And an AI that only asks some people gives an unfair answer. So ask everyone.
